    <h1>What Is Virtual Golf? A Beginner's Guide to Indoor Golf Technology</h1>
    <p class="hero-intro">
      Virtual golf lets you play real courses without ever stepping outside.
      This guide explains what virtual golf is, how the technology works,
      and what to expect the first time you step into a bay.
    </p>
